            <h2>Career</h2>
            <section>
                <h3>Early Career</h3>
                <p>
                    Cristiano Ronaldo was born on February 5, 1985, in Madeira, Portugal. He started playing football at a young age and joined Sporting CP's academy. His extraordinary skills attracted the attention of major European football clubs.
                </p>
            </section>
        <section>
                <h3>International Career with Portugal</h3>
                <p>
                    Ronaldo made his international debut for Portugal on August 20, 2003, against Kazakhstan. He became the captain of Portugal and helped his country win major international trophies.
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>UEFA European Championship – 2016</li>
                    <li>UEFA Nations League – 2019</li>
                    <li>UEFA Nations League – 2025</li>
                </ul>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h3>Playing Style</h3>
                <p>
                    Ronaldo is famous for his speed, powerful shots, heading ability, dribbling and incredible fitness. His dedication and hard work make him one of football's greatest players.
                </p>
            </section>
