                    <li>UEFA Champions League – 5 titles</li>
                    <li>FIFA Club World Cup titles</li>
                </ul>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h3>Memorable Seasons</h3>
                <p>
                    The 2007–08 season was one of Ronaldo's breakthrough seasons at Manchester United. He won the Premier League and UEFA Champions League and received his first Ballon d'Or.
                </p>
                <p>
                    During his time at Real Madrid, he produced several outstanding seasons and became the club's all-time leading goalscorer.
                </p>
