            <section>
                <h3>Manchester United</h3>
                <p>
                    Ronaldo joined Manchester United in 2003. He developed into a world-class footballer and won three Premier League titles and one Champions League title during his first spell.
                </p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h3>Real Madrid</h3>
                <p>
                    Ronaldo joined Real Madrid in 2009. He scored an incredible number of goals and helped the club win four Champions League titles during his time there.
